      "consulted_on": "2026-10-16",
      "scope": "Consultation method: direct_page_selected_passages_via_web_open. Section: Tree substance, building stock, woodland and other uses. The noun includes tree substance and prepared building stock, while wooded areas and some objects are different uses. The proposed base names the material in the stored manufacturing context. Neither the source nor this morphology decision prescribes a wood treatment or safety procedure. Limits: Selected lexical and historical passages only. No dictionary examples, full text, media or source exercises are acquired. These paraphrases support a proposed teaching-depth decision; they do not establish independent morphology acceptance, specialist approval, product composition, handling instructions, media licensing or course readiness.",
