      "scope": "Consultation method: direct_page_selected_passages_via_web_open. Section: Inherited tree and tree-material noun; separate obsolete adjective. The material noun continues an Old English word for trees and their substance. A separate obsolete adjective is not this family. The material can remain an intact base, compatible with the wood in woodpecker at component scope while preserving the bird as a different complete target. Limits: Selected lexical and historical passages only. No dictionary examples, full text, media or source exercises are acquired. These paraphrases support a proposed teaching-depth decision; they do not establish independent morphology acceptance, specialist approval, product composition, handling instructions, media licensing or course readiness.",
