      "scope": "Consultation method: direct_page_selected_passages_via_web_open. Section: Material noun and Origin. The material is stiff paper board, and the origin explicitly analyzes card plus board. The current meaning is not a payment card joined to an electronic panel. The stored broader stiff-paper sense need not be narrowed to corrugated sheets. Limits: Selected lexical and historical passages only. No dictionary examples, full text, media or source exercises are acquired. These paraphrases support a proposed teaching-depth decision; they do not establish independent morphology acceptance, specialist approval, product composition, handling instructions, media licensing or course readiness.",
