      "scope": "Consultation method: direct_page_selected_passages_via_web_open. Section: Compound origin and linked card/board passages. The entry traces cardboard to card and board, with an older card paper name. Its linked board passage includes a thick-paper use among distinct physical and institutional developments. The proposed graph follows the established paper-sheet meaning, not every board homograph. Limits: Selected lexical and historical passages only. No dictionary examples, full text, media or source exercises are acquired. These paraphrases support a proposed teaching-depth decision; they do not establish independent morphology acceptance, specialist approval, product composition, handling instructions, media licensing or course readiness.",
