      "scope": "Consultation method: direct_page_selected_passages_via_web_open. Section: Stiff paper object, payment/computer uses and separate fiber-combing homograph. Card can denote a stiff paper piece and several functional objects. A separate card word refers to combing fibers. The cardboard constituent is aligned with the existing Growth paper-card family; neither payment authority nor textile-combing meaning is imported. Limits: Selected lexical and historical passages only. No dictionary examples, full text, media or source exercises are acquired. These paraphrases support a proposed teaching-depth decision; they do not establish independent morphology acceptance, specialist approval, product composition, handling instructions, media licensing or course readiness.",
