      "scope": "Consultation method: direct_page_selected_passages_via_web_open. Section: Flat material, sheet/bookbinding, meals, directing group and electronic senses. Board includes thin flat material, stiff sheets and book-cover material, alongside meal, group and electronic senses. The sheet component in cardboard supports the already distinct Growth sheet identity. Similar spelling does not make a shelf, writing board, input panel or meal arrangement a donor. Limits: Selected lexical and historical passages only. No dictionary examples, full text, media or source exercises are acquired. These paraphrases support a proposed teaching-depth decision; they do not establish independent morphology acceptance, specialist approval, product composition, handling instructions, media licensing or course readiness.",
