      "scope": "Consultation method: direct_page_selected_passages_via_web_open. Section: Biological, wrapping/soft-paper and woven-fabric senses; Origin. The dictionary separates body-cell material, tissue paper, soft papers and woven fabric. These senses have a historical relationship through weaving. A wrapping-paper constituent can be explicitly scoped without approving the existing mixed Professional tissue family or equating it with the Growth nose-wiping noun. Limits: Selected lexical and historical passages only. No dictionary examples, full text, media or source exercises are acquired. These paraphrases support a proposed teaching-depth decision; they do not establish independent morphology acceptance, specialist approval, product composition, handling instructions, media licensing or course readiness.",
